  "description": "*“Serena… seems to be possessed by a demon.”* \n\nNathaniel, a priest of lowly birth. After returning to his hometown, the Earldom of Graves, after ten years, he found that Serena, the young lady he had served, was possessed by a demon. Unable to resist the earl’s pressure, he went to check on Serena’s condition…\n\n *“Ah, ahh… ugh.”*\n\nSerena moaned strangely and slowly kneaded her ample breasts.\n\n *“Ugh, hah, Nate.”*\n\nA very low-level demon had possessed his former master who had been treated so badly. The demon of lust.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
